WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
Our final section is on temperature-related illness,

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.660
focusing on what happens when the body can no longer regulate

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.340
its own heat in extreme environments.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.380
In the upcoming slides, we'll cover

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.540
how to identify and treat emergencies

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.180
at both ends of the scale, from life-threatening heat stroke

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.980
to the dangers of freezing and hypothermia.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:22.580
Because these conditions can escalate rapidly,

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.780
knowing the early warning signs is your most important tool

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:28.100
as an everyday hero.

